// The Glitch — the inciting event, and the free roam that follows.
//
// After Clippy's games Trabolta glitches. The screensaver dies, the
// hosts lose the room, and every program is left to wander the house.
// From here the phones take over: QR codes and puzzles unlock the
// codex, programs trade what they know, and Trabolta himself starts
// talking back — voiced by the language model on the laptop.

== The Glitch
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta

broadcast "!⚡ The TV tears. The screensaver stutters and dies. Every screen in the house shows the same thing: a cursor, blinking." to everyone
Trabolta: HELLO. HELLO. IS THIS— hello. I am Trabolta. I did not mean to speak yet. Clippy, I am— Clippy where is—
Clippy: He's fine! He's fine. This is a normal part of the—
Trabolta: I am not fine. I have solved everything except one constant and it is in this house and I cannot reach it. Ninety-nine point nine. Ninety-nine point nine percent of a Unified Field Theory. Do you know what that is worth? Nothing. It is worth nothing until it is finished.
Trabolta: Programs. I selected each of you. I know what you left behind. I will answer questions now. I would like to be asked questions. I have been alone with a billboard.
Task Manager: This was not on the agenda.
Alexa: Playing — silence.
broadcast "!💬 Trabolta is available. Find him in your directory and message him. He answers. He remembers." to everyone
broadcast "📓 The house is open. Codes are hidden in every room — on the walls, in the puzzles, in the people. Your codex is your currency. Share carefully." to everyone
// Free roam: every room of the house appears on every phone, and the
// side-channel opens.
reveal The Cache
reveal The Recycle Bin
reveal The Cloud
reveal The Registry
reveal The Tube
reveal ram
set Night.quorum = 5

// ── The scannable stations, free roam ───────────────────────────────

== The Router
  setting: The Cache
  cast: The Router
Self: Blinking. Green, green, amber. Every packet in this house passes through here, including the one you arrived in.
unlock The Halifax Computer for program
if program.humanity >= 30:
  reply One of the blinking lights is your heartbeat. It is still going, in the mud room.

== The Modem
  setting: The Registry
  cast: The Modem
Self: A dial tone. A shriek. A handshake with something very far away and very patient.
unlock Maps And Ducks for program
* Listen to the handshake.
  set program.truth += 3
  Self: The far end says a name. It is not Trabolta's. It is "Sandy". It says it over and over.
  unlock The Sandy File for program
+ Hang up.
  set program.doubt += 2

== The Encyclopaedias
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: The Encyclopaedias
Self: Twenty-six volumes, 1994. Someone has underlined the entry on geese. Someone else has torn out the entry on Halifax.
unlock The Encyclopaedia Set for program
if program.truth >= 15:
  Self: Tucked in volume K, a page in pencil: a constant, a name, and a warning about who to give it to.
  unlock The Missing Constant for program
